\v 9 Kush's¦187102 sons were¦187103 Seba¦187103, Havilah¦187104, Sabta¦187105, Raamah¦187106, and¦187107 Savteka¦187107. Raamah's¦187109 sons were¦187110 Sheva¦187110 and¦187111 Dedan¦187111.
\v 10 Then Kush¦187114 fathered¦187115 Nimrod¦187118 \add and\add* he¦187115 became a mighty¦187122 \add warrior\add*.
