\rem /s2 To Hezron's Sons
\p
\v 3 Yehudah's sons¦187620 (with the¦187620 Canaanite¦187631 woman Bat-Shua) were¦187622 Er¦187622, and¦187623 Onan¦187623, and¦187624 Shelah¦187624. (Yehudah's eldest¦187635 son¦187625, Er, was¦187626 evil¦187637 in¦187638 Yahweh's¦187639 eyes¦187638, and¦187640 he¦187640 killed¦187640 him¦187640.)
\v 4 His¦187644 daughter-in-law¦187644 Tamar¦187643 had \add twin boys named\add* Perets¦187649 and¦187650 Zerah¦187652, so altogether Yehudah¦187656 had five¦187657 sons¦187655.
