\v 7 \add Zimri had a son named Karmi.\add* Karmi¦187679 had a son¦187678 named Akar¦187680 who¦187681 brought trouble¦187681 into Yisrael¦187682 \add ≈by violating a ban\add* on¦187685 devoted¦187685 things¦187685.\x + \xo 2:7: \xt Josh 7:1.\x*
