\v 42 The¦188110 oldest son¦188110 of¦188111 Yerahme'el's brother¦188112 Kalev¦188111 was Meysha. Meysha was the father of Zif, and¦188110 Zif was¦188117 the¦188117 father¦188117 of Mareshah. Mareshah was¦188122 the¦188122 father¦188122 of¦188122 Hevron¦188123.
\v 43 Hevron's¦188126 sons¦188125 were¦188127 Korah¦188127, Tappuah¦188128, Rekem¦188129, and¦188125 Shema¦188130.
\v 44 Shema¦188132 was the father¦188133 of Raham. Raham was the¦188137 father¦188137 of¦188137 Yorkeam¦188138. Rekem¦188139 was the father¦188140 of Shammai¦188143.
\v 45 Shammai's¦188147 son¦188145 was¦188148 Maon¦188148, and¦188149 Maon¦188149 was¦188150 the¦188150 father¦188150 of¦188150 Beyt¦188151-Tsur¦188153.
\v 46 Kalev¦188157 had a slave-wife named Eyfah who gave birth¦188158 to Haran¦188161, Motsa¦188164, and¦188155 Gazez¦188167. Haran¦188168 had a son \add who he also named\add* Gazez¦188172.
\v 47 Yahdai's¦188176 sons¦188175 were¦188177: Regem¦188177, Yotam¦188178, Geshan¦188179, Pelet¦188180, Eyfah¦188181, and¦188175 Shaaph¦188182.
