\p
\v 13 plus¦191292 Beriah and¦191292 Shema¦191292, who were¦191294 leaders of¦191294 their clans, who lived in Ayyalon¦191297 \add city\add*. They¦191298 forced the¦191302 people who lived in Gat¦191303 city to¦191299 flee.
\v 14-16 Beriah's sons were Ahyo¦191305, Shashak¦191306, Yerimot¦191307, Zevadyah, Arad, Eder, Mikael, Yishpah, and¦191307 Yoha.
