\v 19-21 \add Another of Benyamin's descendants was Shimei.\add* Shimei's descendants \add ≈included\add* Yakim, Zikri¦191331, Zavdi, Elienai, Tsilletai, Eliel, Adayah, Berayah, and¦191330 Shimrat.
