\p
\v 26-27 \add Another of Benyamin's descendants was\add* Yeroham, whose sons were Shamsherai¦191362, Sheharyah¦191363, Atalyah¦191364, Yaareshyah, Eliyah, and¦191362 Zikri.
\p
\v 28 \add @All¦191377 those¦191377 descendants¦191377 of¦191377 Elpaal¦191377 (Shaharayim's¦191377 son¦191377)\add* were¦191373 \add ≈leaders¦191376 of their clans according¦191375 to¦191375 their¦191375 genealogies\add*. They¦191378 \add all\add* lived¦191378 in¦191379 Yerushalem¦191379.
