\v 9 Then¦196283 the¦196284 Ammonites¦196285 marched out¦196283 and¦196283 deployed¦196286 ready for battle¦196287 at¦196295 the entrance¦196288 to their city¦196289, while the¦196290 kings¦196290 who'd come¦196293 were¦196295 over in¦196295 the countryside¦196295 \add with their men\add*.
\p
\v 10 Yoav¦196298 \add quickly\add* realised¦196297 that¦196299 \add ≈he'd have to fight¦196304 on¦196312 two fronts, so\add* he chose¦196308 Yisrael's¦196312 best warriors and¦196297 sent them out to face¦196302 the¦196302 Arameans¦196315 \add !(Syrians¦196315)\add*,
\v 11 while he¦196320 sent the remaining men (under the control of¦196321 his¦196323 \add older brother\add* Avshai) out against¦196325 the¦196326 Ammonites¦196327.
\v 12 Yoav told¦196329 them, “If¦196330 the Arameans¦196334 are too¦196332 strong¦196332 for¦196333 me, then you \add ≈can come to rescue me\add*. \add ≈But¦196329\add* if¦196339 the¦196341 Ammonites¦196342 \add ≈start to gain on you¦196344\add*, then I'll¦196345 \add come to\add* rescue you¦196345.
\v 13 We must¦196358 be strong¦196347 and¦196348 fight hard to defend our people¦196351 and our cities¦196353 \add ≈that belong to\add* our¦196354 god¦196354. Yahweh¦196355 will¦196358 do¦196358 \add ≈what he¦196358 considers to be\add* good¦196356.”
\p
\v 14 \add ≈So¦196360\add* Yoav¦196361 \add ≈advanced his¦196370 troops to¦196366 attack the Arameans, but¦196360 the Arameans fled¦196369 away from¦196370 them\add*.
\v 15 \add ≈When¦196372\add* the¦196372 Ammonites¦196373 saw¦196374 that¦196375 the Arameans¦196378 had¦196377 fled¦196377, \add ≈they¦196379 also¦196379 fled¦196379 from¦196383 Avshai and¦196372 withdrew into¦196383\add* the¦196387 city¦196387, \add ≈so\add* Yoav¦196389 went¦196386 back to¦196387 Yerushalem¦196390.
\p
\v 16 \add ≈When the Arameans\add* saw¦196393 that¦196405 they were defeated¦196396 \add ≈by\add* Yisrael¦196398, they¦196399 sent¦196399 messengers¦196400 to¦196397 bring¦196401 \add ≈more Arameans from¦196406 across the Euphrates river¦196407, led by\add* Shofak¦196408, the¦196409 commander¦196409 of¦196411 Hadadezer's¦196412 army¦196411.
