\v 1 \add ≈Then, in the spring, when kings¦196490 often march¦196489 out to¦196487 war\add*, Yoav led¦196491 the¦196495 army¦196495 out for war¦196496, and¦196497 he¦196497 devastated the¦196501 Ammonites' land¦196501. Then he reached \add the capital,\add* Rabbah, and he besieged¦196506 it¦196506 while David¦196510 stayed¦196511 in¦196512 Yerushalem¦196512. Yoav \add ≈defeated\add* Rabbah and \add ≈demolished the city\add*.\x + \xo 20:1: \xt 2Sam 11:1.\x*
