\v 3 Then¦196549 they took¦196555 all the people out¦196555 of¦196558 the¦196559 city¦196565 and \add ≈forced them to work\add* with saws¦196560, iron¦196559 picks¦196558, and¦196560 axes¦196560. David¦196563 did¦196562 that¦196552 to the people from all¦196564 the¦196565 Ammonite cities¦196565, then¦196549 he¦196555 returned¦196569 to Yerushalem¦196574 with his army.
