\v 1 Then David¦198382 and¦198383 the army¦198384 chiefs allocated the \add musical\add* service¦198385 to¦198386 the¦198386 sons¦198386 of¦198386 Asaf¦198387, Heman¦198388, and¦198389 Yedutun¦198389—the ones prophesying¦198390 with harps¦198394, with lyres¦198393, and¦198395 with¦198395 cymbals¦198395. \add ≈This is¦198396 a list¦198397 of¦198397 the men¦198398 they chose for¦198400 that work¦198385\add*:
