\v 6 All¦198481 of¦198481 those¦198483 served¦198494 as musicians¦198488 in¦198488 Yahweh's¦198490 temple under their¦198487 fathers¦198487' supervision—they played cymbals¦198491, harps¦198493, and¦198493 lyres¦198492. \add ≈Their fathers were¦198484 supervised by\add* the¦198489 king¦198499.
