\v 8 All¦198798 those¦198800 descendants of¦198803 Oved¦198803-Edom¦198804 and¦198806 their¦198806 sons¦198801 and¦198807 relatives¦198807 were¦198808 capable people¦198808 and strong¦198811 workers. Altogether¦198815 there were 62 of them.
\li1
\v 9 Meshelemyah had sons¦198819 and¦198818 relatives¦198820 who were respected (eighteen¦198824 in total).
