\v 20 The¦198945 Levite¦198951 Ahiyah¦198946 was¦198947 \add ≈in charge of¦198949\add* the¦198950 temple¦198950 treasuries¦198952, as well as the storehouses¦198949 for dedicated¦198953 gifts¦198953.
\v 21 Ladam's descendants (\add also\add* descendants of Gershon) \add ≈were¦198964 leaders among their family¦198961 groups. Yehiel¦198964 was¦198964 a descendant of this Ladan¦198956\add*.
\v 22 Yehiel's¦198967 sons¦198966 were Zetam¦198968 and¦198969 Yoel¦198969, \add and they\add* \add ≈were¦198971 in charge of¦198973\add* the¦198974 storehouses¦198973 in Yahweh's¦198975 temple¦198974.
