\v 23 \add Others who did that work\add* \add ≈were descendants of Amram¦198977, Yitshar, Hevron, and Uzziel\add*.
\p
\v 24 Shuvael, a descendant of Mosheh's¦198988 son¦198986 Gershom¦198985, was¦198989 \add another\add* leader¦198989 in charge of the¦198989 treasuries¦198992,
