\v 1 This is a list¦199146 of the Israeli¦199144 men who¦199154 served¦199154 the¦199157 king¦199157 \add in the army\add*. Some were leaders¦199153 of families¦199148, some were commanders¦199149 of divisions of a thousand¦199150, some were commanders of divisions of a hundred¦199152, and¦199153 some were other officers¦199153. There were¦199171 twenty-four¦199171 thousand men in each group, and each group served one month¦199167 each year¦199168.
